    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        104.793701171875,
        520.2554931640625,
        143.51361083984375
      ],
      "text": "Sounds good. So that’s definitely a possibility then. Is there anywhere else you\ncan think of?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        156.45205688476562,
        105.86299896240234,
        175.95346069335938
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        176.43470764160156,
        462.77777099609375,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "If you want somewhere a bit less formal, then you could try Paloma.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        128.062255859375,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        228.1547088623047,
        274.5001220703125,
        246.95361328125
      ],
      "text": "Where’s that? I haven’t heard of it.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        259.89202880859375,
        105.86299896240234,
        279.3934326171875
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        279.87469482421875,
        482.41119384765625,
        318.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "No, it’s quite new. It’s only been open a few months, but it’s got a great\nreputation already. It’s in a really beautiful old building on Bow Street.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.4110412597656,
        128.062255859375,
        350.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        351.5146789550781,
        420.77703857421875,
        370.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Oh, I think I know where you mean. Right beside the cinema.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        383.2520446777344,
        105.86299896240234,
        402.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        526.7369995117188,
        461.75360107421875
      ],
      "text": "Yes, that’s it. I’ve only been there a couple of times, but I was really impressed.\nThe chef used to work at Don Felipe’s, apparently. I was really sorry when that\nclosed down.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.6920471191406,
        128.062255859375,
        494.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        494.6746826171875,
        317.6633605957031,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "So is all the food they serve Spanish, then?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.4110107421875,
        105.86299896240234,
        545.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        546.3937377929688,
        516.8154296875,
        585.1135864257812
      ],
      "text": "Yeah. You can get lots of small dishes to share, which always works really well\nif you’re in a group.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        598.0520629882812,
        128.062255859375,
        617.553466796875
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
